.Dd August 30, 2026
.Dt OPENPROJECT 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm openproject
.Nd CloudBSD OpenProject service helper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm checkconfig
.Nm
.Cm doctor
.Nm
.Cm env
.Nm
.Cm migrate
.Nm
.Cm secret
.Nm
.Cm supervise
.Nm
.Cm version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the CloudBSD helper for official OpenProject %%VERSION%%.
The Rails application lives in
.Pa %%WWWDIR%%
and is served by Puma on
.Li 127.0.0.1:3000 .
nginx terminates TLS and must send
.Li X-Forwarded-Proto: https .
.Pp
Operator configuration is JSON.
See
.Xr openproject.conf 5 .
OpenProject itself reads environment variables.
.Nm
translates the JSON file into those variables
.Pq DATABASE_URL, OPENPROJECT_HOST__NAME, memcached, HTTPS
and writes them to
.Pa /var/db/openproject/env .
That is why a helper exists: CloudBSD law is JSON; OpenProject's
native config is ENV.
.Pp
The rc.d script
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/rc.d/openproject
calls
.Nm
for
.Cm checkconfig ,
.Cm env ,
and
.Cm supervise
so
.Ql service openproject start
works.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width checkconfig
.It Cm checkconfig
Validate that the JSON file exists, parses, and contains the required
keys
.Pq bind, host_name, secret and postgres password files .
.It Cm doctor
Check configuration, secret file modes, pidfile directory, PostgreSQL
reachability, memcached, bind address, and the staged application tree.
.It Cm env
Write
.Pa /var/db/openproject/env
from JSON.
The file is mode 0600 and contains secrets; do not print it.
.It Cm migrate
Write the env file and run
.Ql bundle exec rake db:migrate
in the application directory.
.It Cm secret
Print a new
.Li SECRET_KEY_BASE
to stdout using
.Ql openssl rand -hex 64 .
Redirect it into the secret file and set mode 0600.
.It Cm supervise
Load JSON, write the env file, and exec Puma in the foreground.
Used by
.Xr rc 8 .
.It Cm version
Print the packaged OpenProject version.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width OPENPROJECT_CONFIG
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_CONFIG
Path to the JSON file.
Default:
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/config.json .
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_ENVFILE
Path of the generated env file.
Default:
.Pa /var/db/openproject/env .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent -compact
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/config.json
Operator JSON configuration.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/rc.d/openproject
rc.d service.
.It Pa %%WWWDIR%%
Staged OpenProject application.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/nginx/openproject.conf.sample
nginx reverse-proxy snippet for track.cloudbsd.org.
.It Pa /var/run/openproject/openproject.pid
Service pidfile.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr openproject.conf 5 ,
.Xr rc 8 ,
.Xr nginx 8
.Sh AUTHORS
